ished_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The collection is distributed on campus rather than enclosed in a single gallery; follow campus signage and standard outdoor access rules.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"fiu-frost-art-museum","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Patricia & Phillip Frost Art Museum","title":"Use the Museum as a Midday Art Break","subtitle":"FIU's free public art museum on the Avenue of the Arts","notes":"Check the current exhibition list, leave enough time for multiple floors, and arrive before the final hour for an unhurried gallery visit.","short_summary":"A campus museum where students can step into changing exhibitions without paying admission.","evidence_claim":"The Frost Art Museum says admission is always free and open to the public and lists its location at FIU's Modesto A. Maidique Campus.","source_url":"https://frost.fiu.edu/visit/index.html","source_title":"Visitor Information | Patricia & Phillip Frost Art Museum","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Open Tuesday through Sunday, 11 a.m.–5 p.m.; closed Mondays and most legal and university holidays. Parking may require payment.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"fiu-green-library-seventh-floor","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Green Library Seventh-Floor Quiet Study Floor","title":"Move Upstairs for Quiet Work","subtitle":"A designated quiet floor in the Green Library","notes":"Bring reading or focused individual work to the seventh floor, silence devices, and use a group room if discussion becomes necessary.","short_summary":"A clearly designated Green Library floor for students who need a quieter study environment.","evidence_claim":"FIU Libraries' floor information identifies the Green Library's seventh floor as a quiet stu